# Base URL of the CCE backend API.
# Leave empty (default) for same-origin requests:
#   - dev: vite proxies /api to the backend (see vite.config.ts)
#   - production: the static build is served behind the reverse proxy
# Set only for cross-origin deployments; the backend CORS whitelist
# (CCE_ADMISSION_CORS_ORIGINS) must then include the frontend origin.
# Cross-origin admission-enabled hosts additionally require the access
# token stored on the Config page; the token is never baked into the build.
#VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:9000
